{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": "ἐρί-ηρος, ον, as epith. of ἑταῖρος, perh. faithful, trusty (μεγάλως τιμώμενοι κτλ.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hsch.", "author_abbreviation": "Hsch.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "), ἐ. ἑταῖρος, in sg., only in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 4.266", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": elsewh. always in heterocl. pl. ἐρίηρες ἑταῖροι, acc. ἐρίηρας ἑταίρους or ἑτάρους ἐρίηρας,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 9.100", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 3.47", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; parodied by"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Cratin. 143", "author_abbreviation": "Cratin.", "tlg_author": "0434", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐρίηρος ἀοιδός loyal to his master's house,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 1.346", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al."}]}